# 3. Project Design Phase
**Project Name:** EduGenie - Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

## System Architecture
The application follows a client-server architecture:
1. **Frontend UI:** HTML5/CSS3 rendered via Jinja2 templates for user interaction.
2. **Backend API:** FastAPI routes requests to corresponding module services.
3. **AI Inference Layer:**
   * Cloud Inference: Google Gemini 1.5 Pro API.
   * Local Inference: LaMini-Flan-T5-783M running on PyTorch/Transformers.

## Folder & Repository Architecture
EduGenie/
├── main.py                     # FastAPI application & REST API routes
├── explanation_module.py       # LaMini-Flan-T5-783M concept explanation logic
├── qna.py                      # Gemini 1.5 Pro Q&A logic
├── quiz_module.py              # Quiz generation & JSON cleaning logic
├── summary_module.py           # Passage summarization logic
├── learning_path.py            # Adaptive learning recommendations logic
├── requirements.txt            # Project Python dependencies
├── templates/
│   └── index.html              # User interface HTML template
└── static/
    └── style.css               # User interface styling sheet

## API Endpoint Design
| Endpoint | Method | Input Payload / Query | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/qa` | GET | `question: str` | Answers academic questions |
| `/explain/` | POST | `{"topic": "str"}` | Generates simplified concept breakdowns |
| `/summarize/` | POST | `{"text": "str"}` | Condenses text into summary points |
| `/quiz` | POST | `{"text": "str"}` | Generates 3 MCQs in JSON format |
| `/learn/recommendations` | GET | `topic: str` | Generates a structured learning roadmap |
